2
00:04:47,450 --> 00:04:52,410
幾千の時を巡って今
Crossing a thousand eras now...

3
00:04:52,950 --> 00:04:56,390
僕ら出会えたの
We were able to meet.

4
00:04:56,870 --> 00:05:01,090
ほら 見失わないように
Look, so we don't lose sight of each other...

5
00:05:02,438 --> 00:05:04,608
離さないで
Don't let go...

6
00:05:08,388 --> 00:05:12,088
[Title: 星降る海] [Text: 作詞・作曲：Aqu3ra]
[Title: Sea of Falling Stars] [Text: Lyrics & Music: Aqu3ra]

7
00:05:25,132 --> 00:05:31,272
ねぇ 耳を澄ませて 星の降る音 聴こえるでしょう
Hey, listen closely... Can you hear the sound of falling stars?

8
00:05:34,512 --> 00:05:43,572
もっと近くに来て 誰も知らない 世界が待ってるの 手を取って 踊りましょう
Come a bit closer. A world no one knows is waiting for us. Take my hand and let's dance.

9
00:05:48,088 --> 00:05:56,972
始まりの合図鳴らせば 歌おうラララ 響けラララ
If it's the signal for the beginning, ring it out. Sing, la la la, let it echo, la la la!

10
00:05:57,588 --> 00:06:04,148
暗がりの道も 月明かりが照らすの
Even the darkened path is illuminated by the moonlight.

11
00:06:07,172 --> 00:06:16,952
宙、海の向こう 君の元まで 響くように歌えるかな
Beyond the stars and sea, I wonder if I can sing so it reaches you.

12
00:06:17,832 --> 00:06:26,692
どんな時もここで待ってるよ 祈っているからさ
No matter what, I'll be waiting right here, praying for you.

13
00:06:27,392 --> 00:06:32,512
ほら キラキラ輝く星は
Look, the sparkling, shining stars...

14
00:06:33,272 --> 00:06:42,492
色褪せず 太古から照らし続けてる 君と辿り着けるさ
continue to shine endlessly from ancient times. We'll be able to reach it together.

15
00:06:55,588 --> 00:07:04,168
心には会いたい誰かがいて 羅針盤みたいね
There's someone you want to meet in your heart, just like a compass.

16
00:07:04,872 --> 00:07:13,552
そっと目を開けてみて 見えるものだけが現実じゃないの
Gently open your eyes; what you can see isn't the only reality.

17
00:07:14,292 --> 00:07:24,812
君といる世界は 永遠の記憶に眠るのさ 歌を ラララ 響け ラララ
The world with you sleeps in eternal memories. Sing, la la la, let it echo, la la la!

18
00:07:25,088 --> 00:07:34,772
潮の満ち引きが導いてくれるの
The ebb and flow of the tide will guide us.

19
00:07:35,692 --> 00:07:44,792
途切れかけた夢を見ても 大丈夫 一人にはしないよ
Even if you see a fading dream, it's okay, I won't leave you alone.

20
00:07:46,152 --> 00:07:55,032
何度だって 互いの引力で引き寄せ合うんだよ
No matter how many times, our mutual gravity will pull us together.

21
00:07:56,412 --> 00:08:02,932
宙、海の匂い 君に届くかな
I wonder if the scent of the sky and sea will reach you.

22
00:08:03,612 --> 00:08:12,872
距離なんてないのかな どんな時もきっとどこかで 見守っているからさ
I wonder if distance doesn't exist. No matter when, I'm surely watching over you from somewhere.

23
00:08:16,452 --> 00:08:25,992
ほら くしゃくしゃになって笑う日を 集めて紡いで
Look, gathering and spinning the days we laughed together until our faces scrunched up...

24
00:08:26,512 --> 00:08:35,172
未来へ踏み出す先も 君と心震わせて
Even as we step forward into the future, my heart trembles with you.

25
00:08:39,588 --> 00:08:53,812
叶うさ今 物語を巡ろう
Our wish will come true now, let's journey through the story.

26
00:09:03,588 --> 00:09:13,788
ニコたんがキター！ホロライブデヴィスFLOW GLOWのお笑い担当、虎金妃笑虎です！ニコたんだよー！誕生日だー！がおー！
Niko-tan is here! I'm Koganei Niko, the comedy representative of hololive DEV_IS's FLOW GLOW! It's Niko-tan! It's my birthday! Roar!

27
00:09:14,388 --> 00:09:20,088
ニコたん初の生誕ライブ「星炎-Fierstra Diva-」にご来場いただき、ありがとうございます！
Thank you all so much for attending Niko-tan's very first 3D birthday live, "星炎 -Fierstra Diva-"!

28
00:09:20,688 --> 00:09:32,088
本日のハッシュタグは、ハッシュタグ「ニコたん生たん2026」！(たん」はニコたんの「たん」なのでひらがなです。)こちらでね、スクショたくさん撮って感想どしどしポストしてください！頼ましまーす！
Today's hashtag is #ニコたん生たん2026! (The "tan" is in hiragana because it's Niko-tan's "tan".) Take lots of screenshots here and post your thoughts! I'm counting on you!

29
00:09:32,488 --> 00:09:44,788
今回のタイトル「星炎-Fierstra Diva-」こちらはファイアストラ、炎、星、虎の3つの要素を掛け合わせたトリプルミーニング、ニコたんが作っちゃいました！
This concert's title, "星炎 -Fierstra Diva-", is a triple meaning combining three elements: fire, stars, and tiger. Niko-tan made it up!

30
00:09:45,288 --> 00:09:56,288
まあニコたんが星で、でみんなから星をもらっててみたいな、フェスでさ、初めてのフェスでみんなのペンライト赤かったでしょ？あれはね星だったの！このライブの匂わせをしていたわけです。
Well, Niko-tan is the star, and I'm getting stars from everyone... At the festival, the very first festival, everyone's penlights were red, right? Those were stars! I was dropping hints about this live all along.

31
00:09:56,488 --> 00:10:03,788
計画通りってわけさ。今回はたくさんのディバたちと、そんなニコたんの星を感じられるような感じで、たくさん歌い
Just as planned! This time, I want you to feel those many Divas and Niko-tan's stars, singing lots of...

32
00:10:04,621 --> 00:10:06,461
って、かっこいいメインのライブになっております！
...It's become such a cool, main-stage kind of live!

33
00:10:06,921 --> 00:10:09,721
1曲目は星降る海を歌っていただきました。
For the first song, I performed "Hoshi Furu Umi".

34
00:10:10,001 --> 00:10:12,241
皆さんどうりだったでしょうか、ニコたん
How was it for everyone? Did Niko-tan

35
00:10:12,301 --> 00:10:14,101
清楚でしたでしょうか？
seem pure and ladylike?

36
00:10:14,721 --> 00:10:19,201
この後はゲストのディバたちとの時間です。それではゲストパート、レッツゴー！
Up next is time with our Diva guests. So, let's kick off the guest part!

37
00:10:29,401 --> 00:10:33,201
涙が夜に溶けて 空が今日も遠くなる
Tears melt into the night, and the sky grows ever more distant today.

38
00:10:34,161 --> 00:10:38,721
未来が綴じたように 暗闇が満ちている
Darkness fills the space, as if the future has been bound away.

39
00:10:39,661 --> 00:10:44,221
あぁ、醜い心も 掠れそうな言葉も
Ah, even an ugly heart, even words that seem to grow raspy—

40
00:10:44,281 --> 00:10:48,961
すべて見透かしたように 星が輝いていた
as if seeing right through everything, the stars were shining brightly.

41
00:11:11,121 --> 00:11:17,281
夜鷹のように高く空を駆けて往けたら 綺麗だって囃されて 特別になれたのに
If I could soar high across the sky like a nighthawk, I'd have been praised as beautiful and made to feel special...

42
00:11:20,721 --> 00:11:27,481
そう俯いた目には憧れしか映らない 誰かの書いた地図じゃ灯る場所は探せない
Even so, in lowered eyes only yearning is reflected; in someone else's drawn map, I can't find a place to light up.

43
00:11:30,821 --> 00:11:37,721
あぁ僕らの現状は いじらしくフラットして 気を抜けば明日が昨日になってしまう
Ah, our present state is pathetically flat; if we let our guard down, tomorrow will just become yesterday.

44
00:11:41,721 --> 00:11:46,081
これはそう 今日を諦めなかった故のストーリー
This is, yes, the story of not giving up on today—

45
00:11:46,321 --> 00:11:51,641
風切羽響かせて空を目指して 惨めになって 嫌になったって 輝いてる夢を
letting primary wing feathers echo as I aim for the sky, becoming pathetic, hating it all, the dream that shines—

46
00:11:51,821 --> 00:11:55,621
叶える羽は 疾っくの疾うに生えていた 吐き出す息が白冷めて
the wings to fulfill it had long since grown. The breath I exhale turns ice-white,

47
00:12:02,481 --> 00:12:10,381
声も聞こえなくなって 燃え上がる体温が夜空を焦がすまで 誰よりもっともっと向こうへって 羽ばたいた 星の一瞬を
until voice is no longer heard, until the burning body temperature scorches the night sky, soaring further beyond anyone else, chasing the star's fleeting moment—

48
00:12:20,781 --> 00:12:25,781
あぁ夜空はずっと待っている 灯る日を、待っている きっときっと
Ah, the night sky is always waiting, waiting for the day to ignite, surely, surely...

49
00:12:36,481 --> 00:12:45,081
「いつか」なんて誤魔化して 「誰か」になすりつけて 「どこか」なんて慰めて 「なにか」に縋っている
Fobbing it off with "someday" and blaming someone else, comforting myself somewhere and clinging to something—

50
00:12:45,921 --> 00:12:49,581
あぁ、それこそが僕だ 汚れきった心だ
Ah, that very thing is me, a heart stained completely foul.

51
00:12:50,281 --> 00:12:54,781
夜鷹にはなれない だから今日を飛んだんだ
I cannot become a nighthawk, and that's why I took flight today.

52
00:12:55,781 --> 00:13:03,281
あぁ、僕らの結末は 面白いほどナーバスで 予測なんて一つも 宛にならないから
Ah, our conclusion is hilariously nervous, because not a single prediction can be relied upon!

53
00:13:07,721 --> 00:13:15,921
これはまだ 僕を諦めなかった故のストーリー 枯れた喉を 響かせて 後悔を追い越して
This is still the story of me who didn't give up today, letting parched throats echo as we outrun regret...

54
00:13:16,721 --> 00:13:23,721
世界にとって僕にとってふさわしかった役なんて 要らない 知らない 所詮僕は僕だった
Whatever role suited the world or me—I don't need it, I don't care, after all, I was just me.

55
00:13:26,781 --> 00:13:35,281
それならどうかこの涙を忘れないで 疲れ果ててこの空から落ちるまで
If so, then please don't forget these tears, until we are exhausted and fall from this sky—

56
00:13:36,781 --> 00:13:43,781
今よりもっと もっと向こうへって 羽ばたいた 星が鳴いている
the star that soared further and further beyond right now is crying out.

57
00:13:46,781 --> 00:13:50,721
あぁ、夜空が白け出している 陽が昇り出している そっと
Ah, the night sky is turning pale, the sun is beginning to rise, softly...

58
00:14:01,581 --> 00:14:05,681
あれから始まって これから終わっていく
Starting from back then, ending from here on out—

59
00:14:06,281 --> 00:14:10,381
一つ、一つ、一瞬を確かめていく
checking each and every single moment one by one.

60
00:14:11,081 --> 00:14:15,781
誰とも 同じじゃない 誰にも 似ていない
Not the same as anyone else, looking like no one else,

61
00:14:16,281 --> 00:14:20,781
一人、一人、とても不確かな空を 飛んでいるのさ
each and every one of us so uncertainly flying through the sky.

62
00:14:21,381 --> 00:14:27,281
僕らの現状は 気持ちひとつで シャープして
Our current state can be sharpened with just one feeling,

63
00:14:27,381 --> 00:14:30,781
怯えていた明日を昨日に変えてしまえる
turning the frightened tomorrow into yesterday!

64
00:14:32,381 --> 00:14:40,381
これはそう 今日を諦めなかった故のストーリー 風切羽 響かせて 空を目指して
This is the story of not giving up on today, letting primary wing feathers echo as we aim for the sky—

65
00:14:40,781 --> 00:14:50,781
惨めになって 嫌になったって 輝いてる夢を 叶える羽は 疾っくの疾うに生えていた
becoming pathetic, hating it all, fulfilling the dream to shine! The wings to fulfill it had long since grown...

66
00:14:51,621 --> 00:15:00,781
吐き出す息が白冷めて 声も聞こえなくなって 燃え上がる体温が 夜空を焦がすまで
The breath we exhale turns ice-white, our voices become inaudible, until the burning body temperature scorches the night sky!

67
00:16:16,204 --> 00:16:21,434
いつか君が瞳に灯す愛の光が
Someday, the light of love you kindle in your eyes...

68
00:16:21,784 --> 00:16:29,084
時を超えて滅び急ぐ世界の夢を確かに一つ壊すだろう
Transcending time, it will surely destroy one dream of a world rushing to ruin.

69
00:16:32,434 --> 00:16:38,884
躊躇いを飲み干して 君が望むモノは何?
Swallowing your hesitation, what is it that you desire?

70
00:16:39,384 --> 00:16:45,834
こんな欲深い憧れの行方に儚い明日はあるの?
Is there a fleeting tomorrow for the fate of such greedy yearnings?

71
00:16:48,684 --> 00:16:56,034
子供の頃夢に見てた 古の魔法のように
Like the ancient magic I dreamed of when I was a child,

72
00:16:56,584 --> 00:17:03,684
闇さえ砕く力で微笑む君に会いたい
I want to see you smiling with the power to shatter even the darkness.

73
00:17:07,434 --> 00:17:14,784
怯えるこの手の中には手折られた花の勇気
In this trembling hand is the courage of a plucked flower.

74
00:17:15,384 --> 00:17:20,784
想いだけが頼る全て光を呼び覚ます願い
Feelings are my only reliance, a wish that summons the light.

75
00:17:29,234 --> 00:17:34,534
いつか君も誰かの為に強い力を望むのだろう
Someday, you too will wish for strong power for someone's sake.

76
00:17:36,884 --> 00:17:43,684
愛が胸を捉えた夜に未知の言葉が生まれて来る
On a night when love captures the heart, unknown words are born.

77
00:17:44,634 --> 00:17:50,584
迷わずに行けるなら心が砕けてもいいわ
If I can go without hesitation, even if my heart shatters, it's fine.

78
00:17:51,384 --> 00:17:58,984
いつも目の前の哀しみに立ち向かう為の呪文が欲しい
I always want a spell to face the sorrow right before me.

79
00:18:01,834 --> 00:18:08,684
君はまだ夢見る記憶 私は眠らない明日
You are still dreaming memories, I am a sleepless tomorrow.

80
00:18:09,334 --> 00:18:16,084
二人が出会う奇跡を勝ち取る為に進むわ
I will press on to win the miracle of us meeting.

81
00:18:20,134 --> 00:18:27,684
怯えるこの手の中には手折られた花の刃
In this trembling hand is the blade of a plucked flower.

82
00:18:28,284 --> 00:18:33,984
想いだけが生きる全て心に振りかざす願い
Feelings are everything I live for, a wish brandished in my heart.

83
00:19:33,634 --> 00:19:38,534
囚われた太陽の輝く
The radiance of the captive sun...

84
00:19:41,584 --> 00:19:46,584
不思議の国の本が好きだった頃
...back when I loved the books of Wonderland.

85
00:19:48,584 --> 00:19:54,584
願いはきっと叶うと教えるお伽噺を信じた
Believing the fairy tales that taught wishes will surely come true...

86
00:19:57,384 --> 00:20:00,384
光と影の中
...amidst light and shadow.

87
00:20:12,089 --> 00:20:16,139
静かに咲き乱れていた
Quietly bursting into bloom

88
00:20:16,139 --> 00:20:20,339
古の魔法優しく
Gently, ancient magic

89
00:20:20,339 --> 00:20:27,639
世界を変える力がその手にあると囁く
Whispering that the power to change the world lies in your hands

90
00:20:27,639 --> 00:20:35,639
終わらない夢を見よう 君と行く時の中で
Dream an endless dream, within the time we share together

91
00:20:35,639 --> 00:20:42,339
想いだけが生きる 全て命を作るのは願い
Only feelings live on; what creates all life is a wish

92
00:20:43,839 --> 00:20:46,639
Yeah...

93
00:21:49,039 --> 00:21:53,039
[Title: サンドリヨン
作詞：orange 作曲：Dios／シグナルP]
[Title: Cendrillon
Lyrics: orange Music: Dios / Signal-P]

94
00:22:00,639 --> 00:22:03,339
朝まで踊る 夢だけ見せて
Dance until morning, show me only a dream

95
00:22:03,339 --> 00:22:07,139
時計の鐘が解く魔法
The magic unraveled by the clock's chime

96
00:22:07,139 --> 00:22:14,139
曖昧な指 誘う階段 三段飛ばしで跳ねていく
Ambiguous fingers beckon up the stairs, skipping three steps as you leap

97
00:22:14,839 --> 00:22:19,839
馬車の中で震えてた 惨めな古着 廻り廻れ 夜の舞踏
Trembling inside the carriage in my wretched old clothes, spin and spin, the night's masquerade

98
00:22:20,139 --> 00:22:26,839
見知らぬ顔探す 囁くあの声が 握り締めた刃 突き立て 全てを奪えと
Searching for an unfamiliar face, that whispering voice urges: raise the clutched blade and take everything

99
00:22:41,839 --> 00:22:45,339
孤児集う城 笑み仮面に描いて
Drawing smiling masks in the castle where orphans gather

100
00:22:45,839 --> 00:22:54,839
偽りの慈しみさえ 羽根で包むセラフ
Even feigned affection is enfolded by seraph wings

101
00:22:55,339 --> 00:23:05,339
灰の中で赤く 溶けて交じるガラスの靴
Melting and mixing red in the ashes, my glass slippers

102
00:23:07,839 --> 00:23:16,339
灰の中で赤く 溶けて交じるガラスの靴
Melting and mixing red in the ashes, my glass slippers

103
00:23:20,839 --> 00:23:26,839
今更帰る 震えているの あなたが目をやる時計
Returning now, trembling at the clock you are eyeing

104
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:33,839
靴脱ぎ踊る スロープ抜けて ここまで伸びる指の先で
Dancing as I take off my shoes, slipping through the slope, with fingertips reaching up this far

105
00:23:34,839 --> 00:23:45,839
すくう雫 口付けて 走る衝動 背骨抜けてゆく刹那
Kissing the scooped droplet, a surging impulse rushing down my spine in that fleeting moment

106
00:23:48,839 --> 00:23:59,839
鐘は鳴らさないで あなたに跪き まだダメと叫んだ右手が 突き刺すサヨナラ
Do not let the bell ring, kneeling before you, my right hand screaming "not yet" as it delivers a piercing farewell

107
00:24:01,839 --> 00:24:10,839
消せない硝煙を 香水にまとう姫 強い瞳 僕の凍った仮面ごと打ち抜く
A princess wearing unerasable gunpowder smoke as perfume, with strong eyes, you pierce right through my frozen mask

108
00:24:20,839 --> 00:24:32,839
今も 耳にあなたの吐息が 突き刺さるの 遠い夢 ステンドグラス越し 光る月が 君に被せたベール
Even now, your sigh pierces my ears, a distant dream; the moonlight shining through the stained glass casts a veil over you

109
00:24:46,839 --> 00:24:58,839
ドレス 膝で咲いて ティアラは投げ捨てて 見つめ合う瞳と瞳が 火花を放つ
Dresses blooming at our knees, casting the tiara aside, our gazes meeting as sparks fly

110
00:26:03,810 --> 00:26:08,960
側にいても 離れたまま ひとつになれない連星
Even when we're close, we remain apart, a binary star that can never become one...

111
00:26:09,760 --> 00:26:12,560
アルビレオ
Albireo...

112
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:18,660
[Title: アルビレオ]
[Title: Albireo]

113
00:26:26,660 --> 00:26:31,360
あぁ 君が思うよりも 僕は君でいっぱいだ
Ah, even more than you think, I am completely filled with you.

114
00:26:31,960 --> 00:26:38,960
流星みたいな移ろいを 片時も離さず見ていたいの
I want to watch your fleeting, meteor-like changes without looking away for even a second.

115
00:26:39,760 --> 00:26:44,360
あぁ 僕が思うよりも 君はずっとずっと遠い
Ah, even more than I think, you are so, so far away.

116
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:52,660
重なったように見えるしぐさ 苦しくなるほどに美しいな
Gestures that look as though they overlap are so beautiful they become painful.

117
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:59,060
君が好きって感情が 残らず夜空を飾っている
The feeling of loving you adorns the night sky completely.

118
00:26:59,360 --> 00:27:02,960
心がまだ言い訳を 愛だなんて呼びたくない
My heart still doesn't want to call this excuse 'love'.

119
00:27:03,360 --> 00:27:07,160
君は愛に浮かんだアルビレオを この心奪ったまま
You left Albireo floating in love, having stolen away this heart of mine.

120
00:27:07,660 --> 00:27:13,660
いらないのなら返してよ 他に行き場もないけどさ
If you don't need it, give it back, even though I have nowhere else to go.

121
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:20,660
いまもI miss youの切れ端が 青空に燃えて
Even now, fragments of 'I miss you' burn across the blue sky.

122
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:26,660
側にいても 離れたまま ひとつになれない連星
Even when we're close, we remain apart, a binary star that can never become one.

123
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:30,160
アルビレオ
Albireo...

124
00:27:30,460 --> 00:27:34,960
何光年先で輝いている 君に君に恋をしたんだ
I fell in love with you, shining so many light-years away.

125
00:27:35,360 --> 00:27:40,160
何光年先か測れぬほど 君の光が眩しすぎたから
Your light is so blindingly bright, I can't even measure how many light-years away you are.

126
00:27:40,660 --> 00:27:47,660
何光年先で輝いている 君に君に恋をしたんだ
I fell in love with you, shining so many light-years away.

127
00:27:47,960 --> 00:27:53,160
何光年先か測れぬほど 君の光が眩しすぎたから
Your light is so blindingly bright, I can't even measure how many light-years away you are.

128
00:28:04,360 --> 00:28:10,660
明日を生きる理由を 愛だなんて呼んでみたんだ
I tried calling the reason to live tomorrow 'love'.

129
00:28:11,160 --> 00:28:18,160
君は愛に浮かんだアルビレオを この心奪ったまま
You left Albireo floating in love, having stolen away this heart of mine.

130
00:28:18,660 --> 00:28:24,660
いらないのなら返してよ 他に行き場もないけどさ
If you don't need it, give it back, even though I have nowhere else to go.

131
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:31,160
いまもI miss youの切れ端が 青空に燃えて
Even now, fragments of 'I miss you' burn across the blue sky.

132
00:28:31,660 --> 00:28:37,160
側にいても 離れたまま ひとつになれない連星
Even when we're close, we remain apart, a binary star that can never become one.

133
00:28:37,660 --> 00:28:41,160
アルビレオ
Albireo...

134
00:28:41,460 --> 00:28:45,660
何光年先で輝いている 君に君に恋をしたんだ
I fell in love with you, shining so many light-years away.

135
00:28:46,160 --> 00:28:52,160
何光年先か測れぬほど 君の光が眩しすぎたから
Your light is so blindingly bright, I can't even measure how many light-years away you are.

136
00:28:52,460 --> 00:28:58,660
離れてても消えないまま ひとつにならない二重星
A binary star that never becomes one, remaining unextinguished even apart.

137
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:07,660
アルビレオ
Albireo...

138
00:29:42,160 --> 00:29:46,660
[Title: 星月夜]
[Title: Hoshizukiyo]

139
00:29:55,160 --> 00:30:00,160
子供の頃見上げた
Looking up as a child...

140
00:30:02,061 --> 00:30:06,681
子供の頃見上げた 夜の空に思った あの一つ一つに
Looking up at the night sky from my childhood, in each and every star...

141
00:30:06,681 --> 00:30:14,221
誰かの願いがこもっている
...someone's wish is held within.

142
00:30:18,881 --> 00:30:24,181
その一つがあなたで
And that one of them was you...

143
00:30:24,501 --> 00:30:32,061
すぐ隣で笑ってて ねえ時を止めれるなら
Smiling right beside me. Hey, if we could stop time...

144
00:30:32,401 --> 00:30:39,241
この1秒を切り取って
...and freeze this very second in time.

145
00:30:42,441 --> 00:30:51,581
星降る夜に ただあなたに会いたい
On a starry night, I just want to see you.

146
00:30:52,221 --> 00:31:08,441
あなたの名前を祈るようにそっと 何度も 抱きしめているよ 抱きしめているよ
I quietly pray your name over and over, holding you close... Holding you close.

147
00:31:10,061 --> 00:31:14,721
もう私も大人ね
I've grown up now too, haven't I?

148
00:31:15,781 --> 00:31:27,221
変わったこと 変わらないこと 止まらない時計の針が 冷たく胸を刻んだ
Things that changed, things that stayed the same—the hands of the unrelenting clock carved coldly into my chest.

149
00:31:32,921 --> 00:31:46,301
でもあなたに出会って 日々の眩しさを知って まだ少しこわいけど 今踏み出せる気がしてるよ
But meeting you taught me how dazzling each day could be. Though I'm still a little scared, I feel like I can take a step forward now.

150
00:31:52,601 --> 00:32:02,141
星降る夜に 会いたいが積もるばかり
On a starry night, my desire to see you just keeps piling up.

151
00:32:02,881 --> 00:32:15,141
あなたの名前を祈るようにそっと 何度も 抱きしめているよ
I quietly pray your name over and over, holding you close...

152
00:32:21,281 --> 00:32:31,581
体を追い越していく 私の名前を特別にしてくれたの 今はただ抱きしめてたいの
A throbbing heartbeat outpaces my body. You made my name special—now I just want to hold it close.

153
00:32:38,881 --> 00:32:46,201
いつも想ってるよ 悴んだ手にぬくもり
I'm always thinking of you, feeling the warmth in my numb hands.

154
00:32:53,981 --> 00:33:01,581
目を閉じて その先へ
Close your eyes and head beyond that...

155
00:33:06,201 --> 00:33:15,481
星降る夜に ただあなたに会いたい
On a starry night, I just want to see you.

156
00:33:15,981 --> 00:33:26,601
あなたの名前を祈るようにそっと 何度も 抱きしめているよ
I quietly pray your name over and over, holding you close...

157
00:33:34,721 --> 00:33:42,741
高鳴る鼓動で 裸足のまま駆けていく 私の名前を特別にしてくれたの
With a throbbing heartbeat, running barefoot, you made my name special—

158
00:33:44,741 --> 00:33:51,021
あなたが 照らし続けてる
You keep shining down on me.

159
00:33:52,341 --> 00:33:58,741
星降る夜に
On a starry night.

160
00:34:36,001 --> 00:34:48,501
踏まれた花の 名前も知らずに 地に墜ちた鳥は 風を待ちわびる
Without even knowing the name of the trampled flower, the bird that fell to the ground eagerly awaits the wind.

161
00:35:00,949 --> 00:35:05,349
祈ったところで 何も変わらない
Where you pray, nothing changes,

162
00:35:05,949 --> 00:35:11,349
《不本意な現状》を変えるのは 戦う覚悟だ...
What changes the present is the resolve to fight!

163
00:35:12,049 --> 00:35:16,649
屍踏み越えて 進む意思を嗤う豚よ
You pigs who trample over corpses and mock our advancing will!

164
00:35:16,949 --> 00:35:21,749
家畜の安寧 虚偽の繁栄 死せる餓狼の「自由」を！
Livestock's peace... false prosperity... give us the 'freedom' of the dying starving wolves!

165
00:35:22,349 --> 00:35:31,749
囚われた屈辱は反撃の嚆矢だ 城壁の其の彼方 獲物を屠る《狩人》
The humiliation of being caged is the starting arrow of counterattack. Slaughter the prey beyond the walls, the hunters!

166
00:35:31,849 --> 00:35:36,649
迸る《殺意》に 其の身を灼きながら
Burning your very body with gushing intent to kill,

167
00:35:36,849 --> 00:35:43,849
黄昏に緋を穿つ 紅蓮の弓矢
Piercing the twilight with scarlet, the Crimson Bow and Arrow!

168
00:36:05,049 --> 00:36:09,949
矢を番え追い駈ける 標的は逃がさない
Nocking our arrows and chasing, we won't let the targets escape,

169
00:36:10,049 --> 00:36:14,849
矢を放ち追い詰める 決して逃がさない
Firing our arrows and cornering them, never letting them escape!

170
00:36:15,049 --> 00:36:20,649
限界まで引き絞る はち切れそうな弦
Drawing back to the limit, the taut, bursting bowstring,

171
00:36:20,849 --> 00:36:25,749
「標的」が息絶えるまで 何度でも放つ
Until the target breathes its last, we release arrows again and again!

172
00:36:25,949 --> 00:36:30,849
獲物を殺すのは 「凶器」でも 技術でもない
What slaughters the prey is neither weapon nor technique,

173
00:36:30,949 --> 00:36:36,849
研ぎ澄まされた お前自身の殺意だ
It is the honed intent to kill within yourself!

174
00:36:37,049 --> 00:36:44,649
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen! 焔のように熱く！
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen! Hot like flames!

175
00:36:44,749 --> 00:36:49,649
Wir sind die Jäger 氷のように冷ややかに！
Wir sind die Jäger! Cold like ice!

176
00:36:49,849 --> 00:36:54,849
Wir sind die Jäger 己を矢に込めて 全てを貫いて征け！
Wir sind die Jäger! Putting yourself into the arrow, piercing through everything!

177
00:37:30,349 --> 00:37:37,849
Angriff auf die Titanen! Der Junge von einst wird bald zum Schwert greifen...
Angriff auf die Titanen! The youth of yesteryear will soon take up the sword...

178
00:37:38,849 --> 00:37:52,349
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen!

179
00:37:52,449 --> 00:38:02,849
何かを変える事が出来るのは 何かを捨てる事が出来るもの
Those who can change anything are those who can throw anything away,

180
00:38:02,949 --> 00:38:08,349
何ひとつ「危険性」等 背負わないままで 何かが叶う等...
Without bearing any 'risks' at all, how could anything ever come true...

181
00:38:08,449 --> 00:38:13,849
暗愚の想定 唯の幻影 今は無謀な勇気も
Foolish assumptions, mere illusions; even reckless courage for now,

182
00:38:14,049 --> 00:38:20,349
「自由」の尖兵 賭けの攻勢 奔る奴隷に勝利を！
Vanguard of 'freedom', offensive of the gamble—victory to the running slaves!

183
00:38:20,449 --> 00:38:28,849
架せられた不条理は 進撃の嚆矢だ
The imposed absurdity is the starting arrow of advance,

184
00:38:29,049 --> 00:38:33,849
奪われた其の地平「自由」を望むあの日の《少年》
The stolen horizon—the 'boy' of that day wishing for 'freedom'

185
00:38:33,949 --> 00:38:44,349
止めどなき《殺意》に 其の身を侵されながら 宵闇に紫を運ぶ 冥府の弓矢
While your body is invaded by endless 'intent to kill', carrying purple into the deepening darkness—the Bow and Arrow of the Netherworld!

186
00:38:44,449 --> 00:38:51,849
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen! 焔のように熱く！
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen! Hot like flames!

187
00:38:51,949 --> 00:38:57,349
Wir sind die Jäger 氷のように冷ややかに！
Wir sind die Jäger! Cold like ice!

188
00:38:57,449 --> 00:39:03,349
Wir sind die Jäger 己を矢に込めて 全てを貫いて征け！
Wir sind die Jäger! Putting yourself into the arrow, piercing through everything!

189
00:39:33,949 --> 00:39:40,049
ということで、スペシャルゲスト！可愛い可愛いちいわちゃんに来ていただきました！
And so, our special guest! The super cute Chiiwa-chan has come to join us!

190
00:39:40,349 --> 00:39:45,049
ばあ！みなさんご存じ上から読んでも下から読んでもわまつちまです！
Yay! As you all know, whether read from top to bottom or bottom to top, it's Wamatsu Chima!

191
00:39:45,149 --> 00:39:48,349
にこちゃん、お誕生日おめでとう！
Niko-chan, happy birthday!

192
00:39:48,649 --> 00:39:50,049
ありがとう、ちいわちゃん！
Thank you, Chiiwa-chan!

193
00:39:50,149 --> 00:39:52,349
気づいたらこんなことになってて、びっくりした！
Before I knew it, it turned into this, I was so surprised!

194
00:39:52,649 --> 00:39:58,049
なんか大きくになっちゃってって言うか、すごいサイズになってるんだけど。
I mean, you've gotten so big, or rather, you're at an incredible size!

195
00:39:59,049 --> 00:40:00,849
なんか後ろから光も差してるし。
And light is shining from behind you too.

196
00:40:00,949 --> 00:40:02,649
そう、なにかここが綺麗でしょ？
Right? Isn't this place pretty?

197
00:40:02,849 --> 00:40:03,649
綺麗だね。
It is pretty.

198
00:40:03,749 --> 00:40:04,649
似合うよちいわちゃん。
It suits you, Chiiwa-chan.

199
00:40:04,749 --> 00:40:05,349
ありがとう。
Thank you.

200
00:40:05,124 --> 00:40:08,284
今日はね、ちまちゃんとグレンラガンを倒していただいたんだけど
Today, we had Chima-chan help defeat Gurren Lagann, and...

201
00:40:08,484 --> 00:40:09,024
はい
Yeah.

202
00:40:09,184 --> 00:40:11,624
やっぱりね、ちまちゃんのが、ハイトーンも好きなんだけど
Honestly, while I like Chima-chan's high notes...

203
00:40:11,924 --> 00:40:14,324
かっこよさも好きなのよ。うん、ありがとう。
...I also love how cool it is. Yeah, thank you.

204
00:40:14,924 --> 00:40:18,144
なんかそんな二つを交ぜられたらいいなと思って今回選びました。
...so I chose this song hoping to mix those two aspects.

205
00:40:18,624 --> 00:40:21,584
ありがとう！一緒に歌えて嬉しかった！
Thank you! I was so happy we could sing together!

206
00:40:21,824 --> 00:40:22,484
よかったー！
Yay, I'm glad!

207
00:40:22,684 --> 00:40:25,464
ちまちゃんとバトルできて楽しかった！
It was so fun being able to battle with Chima-chan!

208
00:40:25,824 --> 00:40:27,484
もう大変だったよ、もう！
It was so exhausting, seriously!

209
00:40:28,044 --> 00:40:30,964
戦いっぱなしだったから嬉しいです。
Since we were battling non-stop, I'm happy.

210
00:40:31,344 --> 00:40:32,564
全然！楽しかった！
Not at all! It was so fun!

211
00:40:32,864 --> 00:40:35,144
え、あのゴーレムはなんだったの？
Wait, what was that golem?

212
00:40:35,624 --> 00:40:39,084
あれは町田の剣の国のゴーレムです。
That was a golem from the Land of Swords in Machida.

213
00:40:39,284 --> 00:40:39,844
そうだよね。
That's right.

214
00:40:39,984 --> 00:40:42,564
ありがと、言わせたみたいになってるけど。
Thanks, even though it sounds like I made you say that.

215
00:40:42,884 --> 00:40:46,684
いやもう、すごい強かったよ、ちまちゃんのもうゴーレムが！
Seriously though, Chima-chan's golem was so strong!

216
00:40:47,024 --> 00:40:50,484
ええ、めちゃくちゃ強かったけど、倒されちゃったんだよね、ちまちゃんに。
Yeah, it was insanely strong, but you defeated it, Chima-chan.

217
00:40:50,864 --> 00:40:51,964
そうだよね、ちまちゃん強かったからね。
That's right, because Chima-chan was strong.

218
00:40:52,184 --> 00:40:57,144
ちまちゃんのおかげでさ、なんか町田自身もパワーが、なんかどんどん削られて…
Thanks to Chima-chan, it felt like Machida's own power was getting drained bit by bit...

219
00:40:57,424 --> 00:41:00,564
ちゃ、もうだめかもしれない！まだここだ！時間が、ない！
Chima, we might not make it! We're still here! We're out of time!

220
00:41:00,824 --> 00:41:05,024
ちまちゃん本当におめでとう、ありがとう、これからもよろしくお願いしますね、またね、バイバーイ！
Chima-chan, truly congratulations, thank you! Keep up the good work, see you again, bye-bye!

221
00:41:05,484 --> 00:41:09,384
しまいに出……ばいばーい！
In the end... bye-bye!

222
00:41:17,204 --> 00:41:24,604
Party is over　それでも踊りたかった
Party is over. Yet all I wanted was to dance.

223
00:41:27,804 --> 00:41:37,804
眠れないくらい　情熱の火はいつしか　いつの日にか
Sleeplessly, those passionate days will someday, on some day...

224
00:41:38,904 --> 00:41:43,804
はなから気付いている　焔はいつか消える
Realizing from the start, the flames will someday fade.

225
00:41:44,304 --> 00:41:50,304
ねぇ　なにも要らないはずだった　なのにまだ　I'm so serious
Hey, I shouldn't have needed anything at all, yet I'm still so serious.

226
00:41:50,804 --> 00:41:59,604
ああ　まだ間に合う　ああ　ただ　Burn it up
Ah, there's still time. Ah, just burn it up.

227
00:42:00,104 --> 00:42:04,804
Baby Sorry darling そんなに甘くないよ　でもきっとそんなに悪くないよ
Baby, sorry darling, it's not that sweet. But I'm sure it's not that bad either.

228
00:42:06,804 --> 00:42:13,304
Give me fire! Light it up, Baby 燃やしちゃうぜ yeah
Give me fire! Light it up, baby, let's burn it up, yeah.

229
00:42:25,304 --> 00:42:34,304
燃えろよ　燃えろよ　炎よ　燃えろ
Burn, burn, oh flames, burn!

230
00:42:40,304 --> 00:42:45,304
燃えろよ　燃えろよ　炎よ　燃えろ
Burn, burn, oh flames, burn!

231
00:42:46,004 --> 00:42:51,604
やぁ！千代も八千代　変わりもせずに　ひとのなり　いとをかし　全部燃やせ八百屋お七
Hey! Through generations unchanging, human nature is so fascinating—burn it all down, Yaoya Oshichi!

232
00:42:52,104 --> 00:42:54,604
出でよ舞えよ火の粉　焚き付けるのが仕事
Come forth and dance, sparks; stoking the fire is my job.

233
00:42:54,804 --> 00:43:00,004
ガソリンとステロイド　燃えるさまはお見事　火遊びはしない　ぬるいまね出来ない
Gasoline and steroids, the sight of it burning is magnificent. No playing with fire, no half-hearted moves.

234
00:43:00,304 --> 00:43:08,304
しけたカルマトラウマ　燃やし尽くすマグマドラマ　この飽くなき渇き　青い炎みたい
A damp karma trauma, a magma drama burning it all away, like this insatiable thirst, like a blue flame.

235
00:43:08,804 --> 00:43:18,304
死は過去のひとつ隣　やがて総てひとつとなり　でもまだ消えてないから
Death sits next to the past, soon everything becomes one. But it hasn't faded away yet.

236
00:43:19,604 --> 00:43:26,804
忘れてみたい　情熱の火はいつしか　いつの日にか
I want to try forgetting... those passionate days will someday, on some day.

237
00:43:30,304 --> 00:43:35,304
身体は気づいている　僕らはいつか消える
Our bodies realize it, we will someday vanish.

238
00:43:36,304 --> 00:43:41,304
ゆるやかに若さを溶かして　泣かないで　Why so serious?
Gently melting away youth, don't cry—why so serious?

239
00:43:42,304 --> 00:43:51,304
ああ　まだ間に合う　ああ　ただ　Burn it up
Ah, still in time. Ah, just burn it up.

240
00:43:51,804 --> 00:43:57,804
Baby Sorry darling そんなに甘くないよ　でもきっとそんなに悪くないよ
Baby, sorry darling, it's not that sweet. But I'm sure it's not that bad either.

241
00:43:58,804 --> 00:44:04,804
Give me fire! Light it up, Baby 燃やしちゃうぜ yeah
Give me fire! Light it up, baby, let's burn it up, yeah.

242
00:44:16,804 --> 00:44:22,804
燃えろよ　燃えろよ　炎よ　燃えろ
Burn, burn, oh flames, burn!

243
00:44:23,804 --> 00:44:31,304
Turn it up, Turn it up... 足りない　注ぐ火に油！ Sorry darling Hurry up ああまだ間に合う
Turn it up, turn it up... not enough, pouring oil on the fire! Sorry darling, hurry up, ah, still in time.

244
00:44:31,804 --> 00:44:37,304
Sorry darling Hurry up ああただ Burn it up! Give me fire! Light it up, Baby 燃やしちゃうぜ yeah
Sorry darling, hurry up, ah, just burn it up! Give me fire! Light it up, baby, let's burn it up, yeah.

245
00:44:38,304 --> 00:44:47,304
Party is over　それでも踊りたかった
Party is over. Yet all I wanted was to dance.

246
00:44:48,804 --> 00:44:49,804
…
...

247
00:49:41,415 --> 00:49:45,285
その胸にしまった火に憧れた
I longed for the fire kept locked in my chest...

248
00:49:45,285 --> 00:49:49,585
飲み込まれて消されてしまいそうで
as if I'd be swallowed up and erased,

249
00:49:49,585 --> 00:49:54,685
夕焼けみたいに温かくて寂しくて強かった
as warm, lonely, and strong as the sunset...

250
00:49:54,685 --> 00:50:03,185
その火に言葉選んで 挙げ句間違えた
I chose my words for that flame and ended up making a mistake.

251
00:50:03,220 --> 00:50:05,720
よく晴れた日を未だに思い出す
I still remember that sunny day...

252
00:50:06,860 --> 00:50:11,420
目を伏せたらもう動けなくて
When I closed my eyes, I couldn't move anymore...

253
00:50:12,240 --> 00:50:16,380
嫌われていない事 祈るばかり
Praying only that you didn't hate me.

254
00:50:17,020 --> 00:50:24,800
心全部見せてくれた 何ひとつ出来なかったのに
You showed me your whole heart, even though I couldn't do a single thing.

255
00:50:25,900 --> 00:50:33,880
どんな今を生きていますか 好きだった唄はまだ聴こえますか
What kind of life are you living now? Can you still hear the songs you loved?

256
00:50:34,900 --> 00:50:44,380
くしゃみひとつで笑った泣き顔 離れても側にいる 気でいるよ
A crying face that smiled at a single sneeze, even apart, I'm by your side—or at least I feel that way.

257
00:50:52,780 --> 00:51:00,700
口先だけで繋いだ 知らない手 それでも離さない 一人は怖い
Connected by mere words with an unfamiliar hand, yet refusing to let go because being alone is scary.

258
00:51:01,100 --> 00:51:09,560
疲れた勢いか 色んな事が 奇跡みたいに思えて どうしようもない
Swept up in exhaustion, all sorts of things felt like miracles, leaving me helpless.

259
00:51:10,020 --> 00:51:18,720
少しずつ感じなくなっていく 悔しかった帰り道忘れていく そうしなきゃ駄目な時がくる
Little by little, I stopped feeling things, forgetting the frustrating way back home—times when I had to be like that come.

260
00:51:23,900 --> 00:51:32,300
それでもそう出来ない事もある 黙ったままの指切り 何が解らないか解らないまま
Yet there are times when you simply cannot do that. Crossing pinkies in silence, without knowing what I don't even understand...

261
00:51:36,900 --> 00:51:45,900
星を読んで位置を知る様に 君の声で僕は進めるんだ
Just like reading the stars to know my position, I can move forward with your voice.

262
00:51:46,900 --> 00:51:53,780
さよならを言った場所から 離れても聞こえるよ 約束が
Even far from the place where we said goodbye, I can hear the promise.

263
00:52:20,900 --> 00:52:30,100
その胸にしまった火に憧れた こんな思い気付かなかったでしょう
I longed for the fire locked in that chest—surely you wouldn't have noticed feelings like this.

264
00:52:30,700 --> 00:52:37,900
その火がその目に見えなくても この瞼の裏に青く残る
Even if that fire is no longer visible to those eyes, it remains vividly blue behind these eyelids.

265
00:52:38,900 --> 00:52:47,700
さよならを言った場所には 君の声がずっと輝くんだ
At the place where we said goodbye, your voice always shines on.

266
00:52:47,900 --> 00:52:56,900
君が君を見失っても 僕が見つけ出せるよ 君の声で
Even if you lose sight of yourself, I can find you with your voice.

267
00:52:57,900 --> 00:53:05,700
どんな今を生きていますか 僕の唄が今聴こえますか
What kind of life are you living now? Can you hear my song right now?

268
00:53:05,900 --> 00:53:14,900
くしゃみひとつで取り戻せるよ 離れても側にいる 気でいるよ
We can reclaim it with a single sneeze, even apart, I'm by your side—or at least I feel that way.

269
00:53:52,200 --> 00:54:00,150
ということでサザンクロスを歌わせていただきました！ ちびにこと一緒に歌ってくれてありがとう、出ておいで！
And that's how we performed Southern Cross! Thank you for singing along with Chibi Niko, come on out!

270
00:54:02,000 --> 00:54:08,000
うわぁ！ ありがとう！ にこたんの！ にこたんのよ、ちびにこたん！
Wow! Thank you! Niko-tan's! Niko-tan's here, chibi Niko-tan!

271
00:54:08,700 --> 00:54:11,150
ようやく会えたね！
We finally got to meet!

272
00:54:11,500 --> 00:54:15,000
てか本当に出っかいだね！ 可愛いー！
You're actually huge! So cute!

273
00:54:15,200 --> 00:54:21,100
ありがとう！可愛い、可愛い！てかもう自分の目の中に入りたくない？
Thank you! So cute, so cute! Don't you want to go inside your own eyes?

274
00:54:21,400 --> 00:54:23,900
もう目の中で見たくないよね自分だからね！
It's dizzying not wanting to see yourself since it's you!

275
00:54:24,000 --> 00:54:25,900
食べちゃいたい！
I could eat you up!

276
00:54:26,000 --> 00:54:33,100
え、ちょっと待って、待って！え、可愛い！可愛い可愛い！てか、にこちゃん可愛いんだけど！
Eh, wait a second, wait! Eh, cute! So cute, so cute! Wait, Niko-chan, you're so cute!

277
00:54:33,400 --> 00:54:39,100
ごめんごめん！にこたん、このあと大切なお知らせたくさんしなきゃいけないから、ちょっと待っててくれるかな？
Sorry sorry! Niko-tan, I have a lot of important announcements to make after this, so can you wait a bit?

278
00:54:39,900 --> 00:54:42,900
このあとの…あ、うん、わかった。
After this... Ah, yep, understood.

279
00:54:43,100 --> 00:54:47,100
とりあえず、にこちゃん、このあとも頑張ってね！ばいばい！
Anyway, Niko-chan, do your best after this too! Bye-bye!

280
00:54:47,400 --> 00:54:50,400
リスナーさんもばいばい！
Bye-bye to the listeners too!

281
00:54:50,700 --> 00:54:54,100
ばいばい！ちびにこたん、えらい、可愛い！
Bye-bye! Chibi Niko-tan, good job, so cute!

282
00:54:54,700 --> 00:54:59,400
はあ、ということで、ちびにこたんに来ていただきました！
Haah, and that's how chibi Niko-tan came to join us!

283
00:55:00,377 --> 00:55:01,657
かわいいね！
So cute!

284
00:55:02,057 --> 00:55:07,197
配信はまだまだ続くのですが、ここで告知いっちゃおうか？いくつかございます。
The stream is still ongoing, but I have a few announcements to make here!

285
00:55:07,387 --> 00:55:09,227
まずは、こちら！
First up is this!

286
00:55:11,109 --> 00:55:16,989
[Title: 誕生日記念 2026] 小金井ニコ生誕記念2026のグッズが出ます！やったー！
[Title: Birthday Celebration 2026] Goods for Koganei Niko's 2026 Birthday Celebration are coming out! Yay!

287
00:55:17,627 --> 00:55:20,407
早速ね、1つずつグッズを紹介させてください。
Let me introduce the goods one by one right away!

288
00:55:20,867 --> 00:55:22,097
1つ目は、こちら！
The first one is this!

289
00:55:22,509 --> 00:55:28,679
[Title: 清楚 ニコたん アクリルジオラマスタンド] 清楚ニコたんアクリルジオラマスタンド。イラストは本田ロアロ先生に描いていただきました。
[Title: Pure Nicotan Acrylic Diorama Stand] The Pure Nicotan Acrylic Diorama Stand. The illustration was drawn by Honda Roaro-sensei.

290
00:55:28,789 --> 00:55:39,399
今回の生誕のテーマをもとに、ディーバ清楚なニコたんをイメージして描いていただいてます！清楚なニコたんをね、ぜひアクリルジオラマスタンドとしてお家にお迎えしてください！
Based on this year's birthday theme, it was drawn with the image of a diva-like, pure Nicotan in mind! Please welcome the pure Nicotan into your home as an acrylic diorama stand!

291
00:55:40,169 --> 00:55:41,109
お次はこちら！
Next up is this!

292
00:55:41,389 --> 00:55:46,219
[Title: ちびニコたん ランダム缶バッジ] ちびニコたんランダム缶バッジ。今回もグッズ化してしまいました！
[Title: Chibi Nicotan Random Can Badge] The Chibi Nicotan Random Can Badge. We've turned them into goods this time too!

293
00:55:46,299 --> 00:55:56,239
いろんな表情やポーズのちびニコたんが全部で4種類！ランダムで1種類だけ入ってます！どのちびニコたんが出てくるかは開けてからのお楽しみ！続いてはこちら！
There are 4 types of chibi Nicotans with various expressions and poses in total! Only 1 type is included at random! Which chibi Nicotan will come out is a surprise after opening! Next up is this!

294
00:55:57,359 --> 00:56:09,369
[Title: ちびニコたんを０距離で！？ぬいぐるみショルダーバッグ] ちびニコたんを0距離で！？ぬいぐるみショルダーバッグ！いつでもどこでもちびニコたんといっしょにお出かけできます！いろんなところに連れてってあげてください！あの頭を上げてね、小物入れられます。
[Title: Chibi Nicotan at Zero Distance!? Plush Shoulder Bag] Chibi Nicotan at Zero Distance!? Plush Shoulder Bag! You can go out with Chibi Nicotan anytime, anywhere! Please take her to various places! You can lift her head up and put small items inside.

295
00:56:10,169 --> 00:56:22,819
[Title: 獲物を見つけたニコたん ぬいぐるみキーホルダー] 獲物を見つけたニコたんぬいぐるみキーホルダー！単体で持って行くもよし、さっきのショルダーバッグにつけていくのもよし、いろんなところにつけてニコたん推しをアピールできます！
[Title: Nicotan Finding Prey Plush Keychain] The Nicotan Finding Prey Plush Keychain! It's great to carry around by itself, or attach it to the shoulder bag from earlier. You can attach it to all sorts of places to show off your love for Nicotan!

296
00:56:23,259 --> 00:56:36,719
改めてフルセットはこちら！かわいいし美しい！ちびニコたんを今回もグッズ化できて、清楚なニコたんもグッズ化できて本当に嬉しいです！使いやすいものも多いのでぜひゲットしてください！さらに！
Once again, here is the full set! So cute and beautiful! I'm so happy we were able to turn chibi Nicotan and pure Nicotan into goods this time too! Many of these are easy to use, so please get them! Furthermore!

297
00:56:37,219 --> 00:56:40,249
フルセット購入特典もございます！こちら！
There are also full set purchase bonuses! Here!

298
00:56:40,619 --> 00:56:49,139
[Title: フルセット購入特典] フルセット購入特典直筆サイン＆箔押し複製メッセージ入りチケット風カード！ライブのチケットみたいになってます、今回の。これと、
[Title: Full Set Purchase Bonus] Full set purchase bonus: ticket-style card with handwritten autograph and hot-stamp duplicated message! It looks like a live concert ticket this time. Along with this,

299
00:56:49,289 --> 00:56:57,949
特典のASMRボイスがつきます！タイトルは「野生に戻ってしまった成人女性（虎）」です。
there's a bonus ASMR voice! The title is "An Adult Woman Who Returned to the Wild (Tiger)".

300
00:56:59,199 --> 00:57:07,709
どういうこと！？どういうこと！？最後にカッコ虎ってことは、まあ虎なんだよな？そういうことにしていいよな？グッズさんよ。
What does that mean?! What does that mean?! With "Tiger" at the end, I guess she's a tiger? That's fine, right, merchandise team?

301
00:57:08,319 --> 00:57:13,549
まあチケット風カードにはね、あの心を込めてすべて手描きでサインをさせていただきます！
Well, on the ticket-style card, I'll put my heart into it and sign every single one by hand!

302
00:57:13,779 --> 00:57:26,009
ボイスは「虎として野生に戻ってしまったニコたんを取り戻しに行くリスナー」というテーマで収録です！どういうことなんだろう本当にもう。ま、でもちょっと気になりますよね！ぜひ聴いてみてください！ちなみに過去一恥ずかしそうな内容です。
The voice is recorded with the theme of "a listener going to retrieve Nicotan, who has returned to the wild as a tiger"! What on earth does that mean? Well, I'm kind of curious though! Please be sure to listen to it! By the way, it's the most embarrassing content ever.

303
00:57:26,799 --> 00:57:35,739
グッズは配信後カートオープンです！フルセットは数量限定ではございませんので、ゆっくり購入してください！
The merchandise cart opens after the stream! The full set is not limited in quantity, so please take your time purchasing!

304
00:57:36,469 --> 00:57:39,679
大事な告知はまだありますが、その前に！
There are still important announcements, but before that!

305
00:57:40,199 --> 00:57:43,999
1曲歌わせていただこうかなと思います。ちょっとマイクも変えますね。
I'd like to sing a song for you. I'm going to change my mic too.

306
00:57:50,255 --> 00:58:06,255
次の曲はニコたんのことを推して応援してくれてる皆さんにとても思い出深いあの曲となっております。「歌ってみた」も出させていただいてる曲なんですけど、みんな覚えてるかな？それでは聞いてください、「ヒカリヘ」。
The next song is a very memorable one for everyone who supports Nicotan. It's a song I also released a cover of, but does everyone remember it? Please listen to "Hikari e".

307
00:58:16,255 --> 00:58:17,755
[Title: ヒカリヘ] [Title: 作詞・作曲：miwa]
[Title: Hikari e] [Title: Lyrics & Composition: miwa]

308
00:58:43,405 --> 00:58:50,105
理想現実 ワンクリック 光の速度に変わっても
Even if ideal reality turns at the speed of light with a single click,

309
00:58:50,455 --> 00:58:57,105
地球の裏より遠い距離 アダムとイヴにはなれない
The distance is further than the other side of the Earth, and we cannot become Adam and Eve.

310
00:58:57,305 --> 00:59:08,755
悲しみの生まれた場所たどって その傷 やさしく触れて癒せたなら
If we trace back to where sorrow was born, and gently touch and heal those wounds...

311
00:59:13,255 --> 00:59:23,255
溢れる想い 愛は君を照らす光になれる 切ないほどに
Overflowing feelings, love can become the light illuminating you, so painfully...

312
00:59:24,255 --> 00:59:33,255
たとえ描く未来 そこに私がいないとしても いまはそっと抱きしめてあげる
Even if the future we picture doesn't have me there, for now I'll hold you close gently.

313
00:59:41,255 --> 00:59:48,755
運命だって引き寄せて 輝き続けたいよ
I want to draw fate closer and keep shining,

314
00:59:49,255 --> 00:59:54,255
奇跡だって起こせるって信じたい
I want to believe that even miracles can happen.

315
01:00:00,592 --> 01:00:04,796
信じたい
I want to believe...

316
01:00:08,859 --> 01:00:18,859
遠慮 配慮 言葉の最後 感情記号化されても 心の奥まで伝わらない
Even if restraint and consideration at the end of words are reduced to mere symbols, they don't reach deep into the heart.

317
01:00:19,749 --> 01:00:22,549
ホントの声を聞かせて
Let me hear your true voice.

318
01:00:23,369 --> 01:00:30,129
すべての事に終わりがあるなら
If everything has an end...

319
01:00:30,789 --> 01:00:37,229
苦しみさえ いつか消えるはずだから
Then even suffering is bound to fade away someday.

320
01:00:38,189 --> 01:00:41,749
溢れる想い
Overflowing feelings...

321
01:00:42,309 --> 01:00:52,589
愛は胸を焦がす痛みに変わる いとしいほどに
Love turns into a pain that scorches the chest, so tenderly...

322
01:00:53,549 --> 01:01:13,829
たとえ世界中の 声なき声に責められたとしても 私が全部受け止めてあげる
Even if I were reproached by the voiceless voices of the whole world, I will take it all upon myself for you.

323
01:01:14,509 --> 01:01:22,169
人は悲しみを知るために生まれてきたの
Were people born just to know sorrow?

324
01:01:22,829 --> 01:01:29,769
そんなことない もっと愛を知りたい
That's not true, I want to know more about love.

325
01:01:30,289 --> 01:01:35,609
孤独がぬくもりを知るためにあるのなら
If solitude exists to help us know warmth...

326
01:01:37,049 --> 01:01:44,549
幸せはいつだってそこにあるのに
Even though happiness is always right there...

327
01:02:07,709 --> 01:02:17,189
溢れる想い 愛は君を照らす 光になれる切ないほどに
Overflowing feelings, love can illuminate you, so tenderly...

328
01:02:22,309 --> 01:02:35,789
たとえ描く未来 そこに私がいないとしても いまはそっと抱きしめてあげる
Even if the future we picture doesn't have me there, right now I will gently hold you close.

329
01:02:36,869 --> 01:02:49,369
運命だって引き寄せて 輝き続けたいよ 奇跡だって起こせるって信じたい
Drawing even fate closer, I want to keep shining, wanting to believe that even miracles can happen.

330
01:02:54,789 --> 01:02:59,309
信じたい
I want to believe...

331
01:03:11,528 --> 01:03:15,828
ということでなんと！ miwaさんに来ていただきましたぁー！
And so, unbelievably... miwa has come to join us!

332
01:03:15,988 --> 01:03:17,328
miwaさーん！
miwa-san!

333
01:03:36,488 --> 01:03:41,588
ニコさん、お誕生日おめでとうございます！
Niko-san, happy birthday!

334
01:03:39,408 --> 01:03:42,088
ありがとうございます！めっちゃ嬉しいです！
Thank you so much! I'm so happy!

335
01:03:42,528 --> 01:03:56,068
実はmiwaさんとはデビュー当初の歌ってみた『光へ』を作らせていただいて、そのご縁でまさかこうして一緒に歌えることが叶うなんて本当に夢のようでございます、miwaさん！
Actually, miwa-san, you created the 'Hikari e' cover for my debut, and never in my wildest dreams did I imagine we'd get to sing it together because of that connection. It's truly like a dream, miwa-san!

336
01:03:56,568 --> 01:04:00,648
こちらこそです！とっても嬉しいです。美しかった！
Same here! I'm so happy. It was beautiful!

337
01:04:01,408 --> 01:04:13,308
そして、ここでなんと！重大な告知、２つ目がございます！ なんとmiwaさんに作詞作曲をしていただいたニコたん初めてのオリジナル曲が決定いたしました！
And now, amazingly, we have our second major announcement! Niko-tan's very first original song, written and composed by miwa-san, has been decided!

338
01:04:13,588 --> 01:04:15,728
やったー！
Yay!

339
01:04:16,008 --> 01:04:19,288
miwaさん、そのタイトルをぜひ発表していただけてもいいでしょうか？
miwa-san, could you please announce the title?

340
01:04:19,708 --> 01:04:22,748
私でいいんでしょうか？ 私でいいんじゃないですか？
Is it really okay for me? Isn't it fine?

341
01:04:24,048 --> 01:04:26,088
それでは発表させていただきます、お願いします！
Then I will make the announcement. Please go ahead!

342
01:04:27,528 --> 01:04:29,768
タイトルは…『星炎』です！
The title is... 'Seien'!

343
01:04:30,168 --> 01:04:35,228
星炎です！星の炎と書いて『星炎』です。
Seien! Written with the characters for star and flame, 'Seien'.

344
01:04:35,688 --> 01:04:49,168
実は今回のライブのタイトルにもなってます。『星炎-Fierstra Diva-』今回のセットリストも星と炎の曲で作られていて、今回最後にこれからmiwaさんに作っていただいた『星炎』を歌わせていただきます。
Actually, it's also the title of this live concert: 'Seien -Fierstra Diva-'. The setlist for this concert was built around songs of stars and flames, and at the very end, we will perform 'Seien', which miwa-san made for us.

345
01:04:49,488 --> 01:05:01,608
ニコたんがこうしてホロライブに来て、こうしてmiwaさんと出会ったり嬉しいこともたくさんありながらもやっぱり活動で悩んだり、辛いこととか、なんか葛藤とか、そういうものがいっぱいあったんですけど
Niko-tan came to hololive, met miwa-san, and experienced so many wonderful things, but she also faced many struggles, hardships, and conflicts in her activities...

346
01:05:02,954 --> 01:05:11,114
それを全部miwaさんに聞いてもらって、あの歌をね、作っていただきました。曲も作っていただきました。本当に皆さん、ありがとうございます！
I had miwa listen to all of it, and she made that song for us. She even composed the music. Thank you all so much!

347
01:05:11,454 --> 01:05:15,194
ありがとうございます！もう本当に光栄です。
Thank you so much! It's truly an honor.

348
01:05:15,694 --> 01:05:23,174
ね、miwaさんの曲一緒に歌えて本当に光栄ですし、今日一緒に光を歌えて本当に嬉しかったです。
Right, getting to sing miwa's song together is such an honor, and I was so happy to get to sing "Hikari e" together today.

349
01:05:23,314 --> 01:05:27,074
では、この後歌う新曲「星炎」楽しみにしてるね。私もみんなと一緒にそこで見てるよ！
Well then, I'm really looking forward to the new song "Fierstra" we're singing next. I'll be watching right there with everyone!

350
01:05:27,374 --> 01:05:29,154
ここにいるの！
I'm right here!

351
01:05:29,374 --> 01:05:31,819
皆さん、これからもよろしくお願いします！
Everyone, thank you for your continued support!

352
01:05:31,819 --> 01:05:32,419
よろしくお願いします！
Thank you for having me!

353
01:05:35,574 --> 01:05:40,054
ありがとうございました！ありがとうございました！ばいばーい！
Thank you very much! Thank you so much! Bye-bye!

354
01:05:40,354 --> 01:05:41,694
頑張って！
Do your best!

355
01:05:41,694 --> 01:05:43,834
ばいばーい！
Bye-bye!

356
01:05:46,834 --> 01:05:53,934
ああもうmiwaさん、可愛いし美しいし歌声は素晴らしいしもう素敵だし本当に語彙力どこだ。
Ah, miwa is so cute, beautiful, has an amazing voice, and is just wonderful... I've completely lost my vocabulary!

357
01:05:56,054 --> 01:06:03,954
ってことで、新曲を歌うためにステージ移動したいと思います。聞いてください、「星炎」。
So, with that, I'd like to move to the stage to sing our new song. Please listen to "Fierstra".

358
01:06:18,494 --> 01:06:23,634
[Title: 星炎]

359
01:06:33,634 --> 01:06:37,514
自信なんてなかった ひとりだってよかった
I had no confidence, and I was fine being alone.

360
01:06:37,734 --> 01:06:41,514
プライドに隠れて
Hiding behind my pride,

361
01:06:41,694 --> 01:06:47,894
誰かの視線 気になってばかりで 閉じこもってた
I just worried about everyone else's gaze and shut myself away.

362
01:06:49,594 --> 01:06:57,214
綺麗だなんて 思えなくて 笑えなかったんだ
I couldn't think I was beautiful, and I couldn't smile.

363
01:06:57,814 --> 01:07:07,054
涙で滲んだ 画面の向こう ふいに溶けた心 触れてくれた声
Beyond the screen blurred with tears, my heart suddenly melted, and a voice reached out to me.

364
01:07:08,594 --> 01:07:19,954
「君のおかげで笑えたよ」 その言葉が ずっと この胸を灯す ただ一つの光
"Thanks to you, I could smile." Those words keep this chest lit forever—just a single light.

365
01:07:25,594 --> 01:07:32,734
Fire, take me higher 消えそうな声を 歌に変えて
Fire, take me higher, turning my fading voice into a song,

366
01:07:32,974 --> 01:07:37,974
弱さ抱きしめながら 届けと叫ぶように燃やす
while embracing my weakness, a flame burning as if crying out to reach you.

367
01:07:41,774 --> 01:07:57,474
Fire, take me higher 君の明日を照らしたい
Fire, take me higher, I want to illuminate your tomorrow.

368
01:08:05,794 --> 01:08:13,174
救われたくて 百以上出し切って 疲れ果てた夜
Wanting to be saved, giving it over 100%, an exhausted night.

369
01:08:13,774 --> 01:08:20,014
大事なものって なんだったんだっけ 忘れそうになるの
What was it that was precious again? I'm about to forget.

370
01:08:20,734 --> 01:08:27,954
振り返る足跡 あの頃の自分に会いたい
Looking back at my footprints, I want to meet my past self.

371
01:08:28,694 --> 01:08:40,074
もう戻れなくても 素直になりたい 失くしたくないから
Even if I can't go back, I want to be honest, because I don't want to lose it.

372
01:08:41,574 --> 01:08:47,974
Fire, take me higher 君への想い 歌に乗せて
Fire, take me higher, putting my feelings for you into a song,

373
01:08:48,594 --> 01:09:02,274
こわさ受け止めながら 響けと祈るように燃やす
while accepting the fear, a flame burning as if praying for it to echo.

374
01:09:04,974 --> 01:09:13,574
Fire, take me higher 君の笑顔を灯したい
Fire, take me higher, I want to light up your smile.

375
01:09:14,694 --> 01:09:28,694
壊れそうな夜をこえて 逃げ出しそうな朝をぬけて いまここにいる
Crossing over nights that feel like they'll break, passing through mornings that feel like running away, I am here now.

376
01:09:30,374 --> 01:09:36,814
私のつくる世界で 君が笑ってくれるなら
If you can smile in the world I create,

377
01:09:38,774 --> 01:09:47,974
この声が生まれた理由 胸にともる星炎
the reason this voice was born is the starlight flame burning in my heart.

378
01:09:48,694 --> 01:09:59,694
Fire, take me higher 私に意味をくれた君へ 声は届いてますか
Fire, take me higher, to you who gave me meaning, are my words reaching you?

379
01:10:00,610 --> 01:10:02,455
Fire, take me higher 私に意味をくれた君へ
Fire, take me higher, to you who gave meaning to me,

380
01:10:02,655 --> 01:10:04,505
声は届いてますか これからもずっと歩き続けたい
can you hear my voice? I want to keep walking forward with you.

381
01:10:05,455 --> 01:10:08,655
Fire, take me higher

382
01:10:08,805 --> 01:10:12,655
消えそうな声を歌に変えて
Turning a fading voice into a song,

383
01:10:12,905 --> 01:10:16,455
弱さ抱きしめながら
while holding my weaknesses close,

384
01:10:16,805 --> 01:10:23,805
届けと叫ぶように燃やす炎
a burning flame crying out so that it reaches you...

385
01:10:24,305 --> 01:10:27,805
炎
Fire!

386
01:10:28,105 --> 01:10:32,505
Fire, take me higher

387
01:10:32,705 --> 01:10:37,605
君の明日を照らしたい
I want to light up your tomorrow.

388
01:10:57,505 --> 01:11:01,155
みんな、歌を聴いてくれて、ありがとうございました！
Thank you all so much for listening to my song!

389
01:11:07,205 --> 01:11:35,651
[Title: 星炎 Fierstra Diva]
[Title: Fierstra Diva]

390
01:11:07,205 --> 01:11:35,651
[Text: ご来場ありがとうございました！！ また歌いに来るね 君が笑ってくれるから声をくれるから君を笑顔にできる 虎金妃笑虎 3D Live 2026]
[Text: Thank you for coming! I'll come sing again. Because you smile and give me your voice, I can make you smile. Koganei Niko 3D Live 2026]

